PostgreSQL VM configuration notes (do not blindly replace your whole config):
1. Keep listen_addresses limited to the VM interface, e.g. 'localhost,192.168.56.10'.
2. In pg_hba.conf, allow only the VirtualBox host-only subnet and require scram-sha-256.
   Example: host pegasus_lab pegasus_app 192.168.56.1/32 scram-sha-256
3. Do NOT allow 0.0.0.0/0 and do NOT use bridged networking.
4. Restart PostgreSQL after making and reviewing configuration changes.
5. The app's lab-check uses a read-only SELECT of current_database(), current_user and version().
